<title>UK: World Bank sets 300 bln lire seven-year bond.</title>
<headline>World Bank sets 300 bln lire seven-year bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-10-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by joint lead managers Banco Monte dei Paschi and Banca Nazionale del Lavoro.</p>
<p> BORROWER   WORLD BANK</p>
<p> AMT    300 BLN LIRE  COUPON     7.625     MATURITY    21.NOV.03</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  101.56    PAY DATE    21.NOV.96</p>
<p> FULL FEES  1.75	REOFFER    =	   SPREAD	 =</p>
<p> MOODY	AAA	 LISTING    LUX	 PAY FREQ    =</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  AAA	 DENOMS (K) 5-50	SALE LIMITS US/UK/IT</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    ENGLISH   HOME CTRY  =	   TAX PROVS   STANDARD</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.50	SELL CONC  1.25	PRAECIPUUM  =</p>
<p> NOTES	ISSUED OFF THE EMTN PROGRAMME</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
